WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.400
Querías controlar a Gina.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.360
to make her entirely

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.680
dependent on you.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.160
But it didn't work

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.760
Because a real man

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.360
came into her life.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.760
You mean that rich guy?

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.280
No.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.480
I mean me.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.120
And you have no idea

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.520
how long I wanted to do this.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.720
Do what?

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.640
Fuck.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.320
I also have to say thanks

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.360
to that rich guy too.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.720
Thanks to his efforts,

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:45.880
Gina's mom

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:47.400
is currently on the helicopter

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.680
to a different clinic.
